        "TileImage": "$($repository 2b024454-35a1-4414-bf67-f2710891e441).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Hokkaido, Japan, where you’ll be infiltrating the prestigious Gama Private Hospital. A place known for its top-tier security and world-class treatment, Hokkaido’s isolation and state-of-the-art facilities make it the perfect location to keep secrets hidden—until now.\r\rYour targets are three critical personnel who play vital roles in maintaining the hospital’s operations and security. Their activities threaten the future of certain sensitive individuals, and it’s time to eliminate &apos;em",
